     sheet_2  strand_c   ala  A  30  ala  A  41  1_555
     sheet_2  strand_d1  ala  A  50  ala  A  52  1_555
     sheet_2  strand_d2  ala  A  90  ala  A  97  1_555
     sheet_2  strand_e   ala  A  70  ala  A  80  1_555
