;

   #
   _pdbx_item_description.name         "_pdbx_database_status.dep_release_code_coordinates"
   _pdbx_item_description.description  "Choose the manner in which you would like the atomic coordinates for this deposition to be released to the public. You may choose to delay the release of your coordinate data until publication or for up to one year from the date of deposition. You must notify the PDB when your paper is published. If you wish the hold to be removed before the year is up, you must notify the PDB. Please note that many journals require the release of coordinate data at the time of publication."
